  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aea490f53db83604eae9c1658210a5b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialKey: tut_expedition_v1
  autoOpenOnEnable: 1
  pages:
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 019385dd2914c452d831fc57d3b0101e, type: 3}
    text: Expedition is where you browse Monster Packs and unlock new packs using
      Pack Vouchers.
  - icon: {fileID: -109353936457988245, guid: df23d2ef5229744a0a8cc432cfb15ddd, type: 3}
    text: The header shows how many Pack Vouchers you currently have available.
  - icon: {fileID: 4224842080577397726, guid: 67fb90c04d1f64b52b10ac50b26e288b, type: 3}
    text: 'This list shows every pack from the Monster Pack Library.

      Each
      row represents one pack you can inspect.'
  - icon: {fileID: 3232479309162599763, guid: d7d6f0e393bda46a08daff1018c2e9a3, type: 3}
    text: "Locked packs appear before unlocked packs, so you can quickly see what\u2019s
      available to unlock next."
  - icon: {fileID: 1188854595336862080, guid: 48ea91dc67a5741889448f45712b1249, type: 3}
    text: "Tap a pack row to open the Pack Detail Panel and view the pack\u2019s
      contents and unlock options."
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: When you unlock a pack, Expedition refreshes the voucher count and rebuilds
      the pack list automatically.
  - icon: {fileID: -109353936457988245, guid: df23d2ef5229744a0a8cc432cfb15ddd, type: 3}
    text: If your Pack Voucher count changes while Expedition is open, the header
      updates automatically.
