--- !u!114 &666553269
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 666553267}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aea490f53db83604eae9c1658210a5b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialKey: tut_stat_v1
  autoOpenOnEnable: 1
  pages:
  - icon: {fileID: 2291750746404757969, guid: ce3a6dc26e8c44aada3227991627a8e0, type: 3}
    text: 'This panel is where you:

      Spend Growth Cores to Level Up

      Spend
      Unspent Stat Points to permanently boost stats'
  - icon: {fileID: 1188854595336862080, guid: 48ea91dc67a5741889448f45712b1249, type: 3}
    text: "At the top you\u2019ll see:\nMonster name + level\nPoints used vs Unspent\nNext
      Level cost in Growth Cores (GC)"
  - icon: {fileID: 4777373978525877068, guid: 7e9b6a9c3f0754d0fb8d6525fca31f2a, type: 3}
    text: "Tap Level Up to spend Growth Cores and gain stat points.\nThe button is
      disabled if:\nYou don\u2019t have enough GC\nThe monster is at max level"
  - icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b05ebb3f339e4f03b3026941ea99ecc, type: 3}
    text: "Use + and \u2212 to allocate your Unspent Stat Points into:\nHP, ATK,
      DEF, SPD.\nYou can\u2019t add points if you have none remaining, and you can\u2019t
      subtract below zero."
  - icon: {fileID: -1527303591572561236, guid: 3ba2637029c5c4ec0a519bf5a5b47d93, type: 3}
    text: 'As you allocate points, the stat values update immediately.

      Green
      numbers show the bonus you are about to apply.'
  - icon: {fileID: 7919402128709028535, guid: f45c9a2b15b7e4f4f9a1f085243b0654, type: 3}
    text: "When you\u2019re happy with your stat allocation, press Confirm to apply
      it.\nConfirm is only enabled when you\u2019ve allocated at least 1 point."
  - icon: {fileID: 7919402128709028535, guid: f45c9a2b15b7e4f4f9a1f085243b0654, type: 3}
    text: 'Presets quickly spend up to 5 points using a recommended pattern:

      Offense,
      Defense, Utility, Balance, Speed.

      Presets only appear after you unlock
      the Preset feature.'
  - icon: {fileID: 5798008345902572713, guid: 398cbd3dce9364b259ad047d0b457946, type: 3}
    text: When you select a preset, the game remembers it for that monster so the
      same style can be used next time.
  - icon: {fileID: -6803709588388684265, guid: 97c560992d5224132848820de6c01194, type: 3}
    text: Closing the panel does not spend anything unless you press Confirm (stat
      points) or Level Up (Growth Cores).
  overlayRoot: {fileID: 1360894576}
  dimmerImage: {fileID: 1101736294}
  iconImage: {fileID: 1149655788}
  bodyText: {fileID: 1867513150}
  progressText: {fileID: 1677173867}
  nextButton: {fileID: 778858771}
  nextButtonLabel: {fileID: 2061142523}
  closeButton: {fileID: 15036666}
  allowEarlyClose: 0
  completeOnlyOnLastSlide: 1
